### GET Order with ID
GET http://localhost:8080/order?id=1

### GET Orders for User with ID
GET http://localhost:8080/order/user?userId=4

### POST new Order
POST http://localhost:8080/order/new
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4,
  "addressId": 5,
  "paymentInfoId": 11,
  "basketId": 49
}

### PUT an update for an Order
PUT http://localhost:8080/order/edit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 18,
  "paymentInfoId": 1,
  "basketId": 1,
  "status": "open"
}

### DELETE Order by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/order/delete?id=17
